# Deployment folder: each server keeps its own deployment files (compose overrides, proxy config, logs, keys).
# Nothing new in it is committed; the install kit already in git (compose.yml, scripts/, smoke.sh) stays tracked,
# because the Docker images, CI and the install package use it. Add a shared file with `git add -f`.
/deploy/
infra/deploy/*
!infra/deploy/scripts/
